second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which award did Amanda J Leach receive?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 108, \"text\": \"**Australian Microbiologist Amanda J Leach Honored with Prestigious Member of the Order of Australia Award**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 110, \"end\": 311, \"text\": \"In a remarkable recognition of her outstanding contributions to the field of microbiology, Australian scientist Amanda J Leach has been awarded the esteemed Member of the Order of Australia (AM) honor.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 312, \"end\": 471, \"text\": \"This prestigious award is a testament to Leach's tireless efforts in advancing our understanding of microbiology and her commitment to improving public health.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 472, \"end\": 641, \"text\": \"The Order of Australia is one of the country's highest civilian honors, recognizing individuals who have made significant contributions to their field and the community.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 642, \"end\": 790, \"text\": \"Leach's work has had a profound impact on the scientific community, and her award is a well-deserved acknowledgment of her dedication and expertise.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 791, \"end\": 1033, \"text\": \"\\\"Amanda Leach is an exceptional scientist who has made significant contributions to our understanding of microbiology,\\\" said Professor Ian Henderson, Director of the Centre for Infectious Diseases and Microbiology at the University of Sydney.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1034, \"end\": 1212, \"text\": \"\\\"Her work has improved our ability to diagnose and treat infectious diseases, and her commitment to mentoring and inspiring the next generation of scientists is truly admirable.\\\"\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1213, \"end\": 1361, \"text\": \"Leach's research has focused on the molecular epidemiology of bacterial pathogens, including the development of novel diagnostic tools and vaccines.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1362, \"end\": 1500, \"text\": \"Her work has been published in numerous peer-reviewed journals, including the Journal of Clinical Microbiology and Infection and Immunity.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1501, \"end\": 1747, \"text\": \"According to the Australian Government's Department of the Prime Minister and Cabinet, Leach was recognized for her \\\"service to medical research, particularly in the field of microbiology, and to the development of vaccines and diagnostic tools.\\\"\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1748, \"end\": 1819, \"text\": \"\\\"I am deeply humbled to receive this award,\\\" Leach said in a statement.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1820, \"end\": 2007, \"text\": \"\\\"It is a testament to the hard work and dedication of my team and collaborators, and I am grateful for the opportunity to contribute to the advancement of microbiology and public health.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2008, \"end\": 2223, \"text\": \"Data from the Australian Academy of Science reveals that Leach has published over 50 research papers and has been cited over 2,000 times, demonstrating the significant impact of her work on the scientific community.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2224, \"end\": 2454, \"text\": \"The Member of the Order of Australia award is a fitting recognition of Leach's achievements, and her contributions to the field of microbiology will undoubtedly continue to inspire and improve the lives of people around the world.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 55, \"text\": \"As the sun set over the bustling streets of Sydney, Dr.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 56, \"end\": 151, \"text\": \"Amanda J Leach made her way to the iconic Opera House, her heels clicking against the pavement.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 152, \"end\": 254, \"text\": \"She had traded in her lab coat for a stunning evening gown, her curly brown hair styled to perfection.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 255, \"end\": 390, \"text\": \"The Australian microbiologist had spent the day in the lab, studying the latest samples of a particularly resilient strain of bacteria.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 391, \"end\": 462, \"text\": \"But tonight, she was being honored for a different kind of achievement.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 463, \"end\": 530, \"text\": \"As she entered the grand hall, a sea of familiar faces greeted her.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 531, \"end\": 686, \"text\": \"Colleagues from the scientific community mingled with sports personalities and celebrities, all gathered to celebrate the year's most outstanding athletes.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 687, \"end\": 798, \"text\": \"Amanda's eyes scanned the room, her mind still reeling from the news that had rocked her world just a week ago.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 799, \"end\": 911, \"text\": \"It was hard to believe that the Associated Press had chosen her, a microbiologist, as their Athlete of the Year.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 912, \"end\": 995, \"text\": \"The award was typically reserved for Olympic champions or record-breaking athletes.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 996, \"end\": 1116, \"text\": \"But Amanda's unique blend of scientific prowess and athletic talent had caught the attention of the selection committee.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1117, \"end\": 1259, \"text\": \"As she made her way to her table, Amanda was stopped by a group of well-wishers, including her coach from the Australian national rowing team.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1260, \"end\": 1292, \"text\": \"\\\"Amanda, we're so proud of you!\\\"\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1293, \"end\": 1324, \"text\": \"he exclaimed, pumping her hand.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1325, \"end\": 1435, \"text\": \"\\\"Who would have thought that all those early morning training sessions on the harbor would pay off like this?\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1436, \"end\": 1504, \"text\": \"Amanda smiled, feeling a sense of pride and gratitude wash over her.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1505, \"end\": 1625, \"text\": \"It was true, her rowing career had been a defining aspect of her life, even as she pursued her passion for microbiology.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1626, \"end\": 1756, \"text\": \"The discipline and focus required to excel in both fields had served her well, and now she was being recognized on a global stage.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1757, \"end\": 1860, \"text\": \"As the evening wore on, Amanda took her seat at the table, surrounded by her loved ones and colleagues.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1861, \"end\": 1988, \"text\": \"The emcee took the stage, and the room fell silent as the nominees for the Associated Press Athlete of the Year were announced.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1989, \"end\": 2103, \"text\": \"Amanda's heart raced as she heard her name called, and she made her way to the stage, her eyes shining with tears.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Member of the Order of Australia\", \"Athlete of the Year\", \"Member of the Order of Australia (AM)\", \"Associated Press Athlete of the Year\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Member of the Order of Australia\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Athlete of the Year\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Member of the Order of Australia (AM)\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"Associated Press Athlete of the Year\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
